  <scopecontent id="c1e259e3870a5740b4da417fd1890d51">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The Affordable Health Insurance series contains background information and reports of health care reform 2007-2009, including issue briefs, and analysis, comparisons, and drafts of congressional bills.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <acqinfo id="8a635a63ef532d8ebbf88f7b4861d4cd">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The Commonwealth Fund records were donated to RAC in 1985. The initial transfer of archival records to RAC began in 1986, and transfers continue on a regular basis. This series was transferred to RAC in 2010 as accession 2010:047.</p>  </acqinfo>
